    "sub": "A new National Institutes of Health-funded study indicates that the experimental drug kamuvudine-9 facilitates recovery from pre-existing vision loss and paralysis in animal.",
    "sub_pt": "A new National Institutes of Health-funded study indicates that the experimental drug kamuvudine-9 facilitates recovery from pre-existing vision loss and paralysis in animal.",
